Aaura Privacy Policy
Last Updated: October 15, 2026

Introduction
Aaura ("the App") is a macOS menu bar app by ARG Studios that draws a circle around your cursor and shows reminders you set. This Privacy Policy explains the App's data practices.

Data Collection and Privacy
The App does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.

We do not collect any information about you, your Mac, or your use of the App
We do not use analytics, tracking, or telemetry services
We do not operate any servers, and the App makes no network requests of its own
We do not use cookies or similar tracking technologies
We do not share any information with third parties
Pointer Movement
To keep the circle under your cursor and to recognize a shake, the App reads the pointer's position while it is running. Positions are used in the moment and are never recorded, saved, or sent anywhere. The App does not read your keyboard, your screen contents, or what you click on.

Local Data Storage
Your settings and the reminders you create (their times and messages) are stored on your Mac in the App's own container. This data is not transmitted to us or to any external service. Deleting the App removes it.

Sounds and Power
Alarm sounds are the system sounds that come with macOS. While an alarm with sound is waiting, the App may ask macOS to keep your Mac from going to sleep on its own, and it wakes the display when the alarm goes off. No data is involved in either.

Third-Party Services
The App does not integrate with any analytics platforms, advertising networks, or third-party SDKs.

Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted at the same address as this policy. Your continued use of the App after changes constitutes your acceptance of the updated Privacy Policy.

Contact Us
Questions about this Privacy Policy can be sent to @memos_app via Instagram messages.

Aaura is designed with privacy as a core principle.
